  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/10/IMG_5031.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>La penya &#39;Xopats&#39; ha celebrado la noche de este s&aacute;bado su fiesta para calentar motores de cara a la Fira d&#39;Onda. Lo han hecho en el caf&eacute;-rock La Oveja Negra, de la calle Mallorca, 25-esquina Sicilia. Entre otras sorpresas, estaba el sorteo de un pack de experiencias y, sobretodo, el deseo de pasarlo muy bien.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festaxopatsovejanegra041014/img_5022.jpg\" alt=\"img_5022\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festaxopatsovejanegra041014/img_5025.jpg\" alt=\"img_5025\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festaxopatsovejanegra041014/img_5026.jpg\" alt=\"img_5026\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festaxopatsovejanegra041014/img_5028.jpg\" alt=\"img_5028\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festaxopatsovejanegra041014/img_5029.jpg\" alt=\"img_5029\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festaxopatsovejanegra041014/img_5030.jpg\" alt=\"img_5030\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festaxopatsovejanegra041014/img_5031.jpg\" alt=\"img_5031\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festaxopatsovejanegra041014/img_5033.jpg\" alt=\"img_5033\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festaxopatsovejanegra041014/img_5034.jpg\